    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>line-segmentize-count · 3×1×1 workgroups × 256×1×1 lanes = 768 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-line-segmentize-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect><rect x=\"21\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"41\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"2\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 256\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-line-segmentize-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"256\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"8\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>256 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override INVOCATION_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const positionsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; positions: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const lineOffsetsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"8\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read&gt; lineOffsets: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const parametersOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"10\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read&gt; parameters: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">const countsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"12\">@group(0) @binding(3) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; counts: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">const LINE_COUNT: u32 = 223u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"14\">const MAXIMUM_PIECES: u32 = 64u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"16\">const NO_LINE: u32 = 0xffffffffu;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">fn findLine(row: u32) -&gt; u32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">  var low = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">  var high = LINE_COUNT + 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">  while (low &lt; high) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">    let middle = (low + high) / 2u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">    if (lineOffsets[lineOffsetsOffset + middle] &lt;= row) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">      low = middle + 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">    } else {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">      high = middle;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">  if (low == 0u || low &gt; LINE_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">    return NO_LINE;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">  return low - 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">const RADIUS: f32 = 1.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">fn getPosition(row: u32) -&gt; vec2&lt;f32&gt; {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">  return vec2&lt;f32&gt;(positions[positionsOffset + 2u * row], positions[positionsOffset + 2u * row + 1u]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">fn getSegmentLength(a: vec2&lt;f32&gt;, b: vec2&lt;f32&gt;) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">  return length(b - a);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">fn getPieceExtent(start: vec2&lt;f32&gt;, end: vec2&lt;f32&gt;) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"49\">  return getSegmentLength(start, end);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"50\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"51\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"52\">fn getPieceCount(segmentLength: f32, maximumLength: f32) -&gt; u32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"53\">  if (!(maximumLength &gt; 0.0) || !(segmentLength &gt; 0.0)) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"54\">    return 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"55\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"56\">  let requestedPieces = ceil(segmentLength / maximumLength);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"57\">  \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"58\">  let pieces = min(requestedPieces, f32(MAXIMUM_PIECES));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"59\">  return clamp(u32(pieces), 1u, MAXIMUM_PIECES);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"60\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"61\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size\" data-line=\"62\">@compute @workgroup_size(256)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"63\">fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"64\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"65\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"66\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"67\">  _ = &amp;positions;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"68\">  _ = &amp;lineOffsets;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"69\">  _ = &amp;parameters;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"70\">  _ = &amp;counts;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"71\">  _ = INVOCATION_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"72\">  let workgroupIndex =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"73\">    (workgroupId.z * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y + workgroupId.y) * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"74\">    workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"75\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 16777216u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"76\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 256u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"77\">  if (index &gt;= INVOCATION_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"78\">    return;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"79\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"80\">  let line = findLine(index);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"81\">  var count = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"82\">  if (line != NO_LINE) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"83\">    let first = lineOffsets[lineOffsetsOffset + line];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"84\">    let last = min(lineOffsets[lineOffsetsOffset + line + 1u], 513u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"85\">    \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"86\">    if (index + 1u &gt;= last ) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"87\">      count = 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"88\">    } else {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"89\">      count = getPieceCount(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"90\">        getPieceExtent(getPosition(index), getPosition(index + 1u)),\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"91\">        parameters[parametersOffset + 0u]\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"92\">      );\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"93\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"94\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"95\">  counts[countsOffset + index] = count;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"96\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>positions<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"positions\">positions</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>lineOffsets<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"lineOffsets\">lineOffsets</td><td>read</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>parameters<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"parameters\">parameters</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>counts<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"line-segmentize-counts\">line-segmentize-counts</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption>GPULineSegm